{"src":"fr","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":175400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"fr","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":5825.3202440000005,"text":"Les lions sont les chats les plus sociables, vivant en grand groupe, populés meutes."},{"kind":"text","t":6103.796340999999,"text":"Lions are the most sociable cats, living in large groups, populated prides."},{"kind":"audio","t":6158.198818999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6159.763220000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6161.229845,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":6162.8893499999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":6163.216101,"samples":12328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":11128.176298,"text":"Dans le climat chaud du Moyen-Orient, la maison n'était pas si importante."},{"kind":"text","t":11428.056319000001,"text":"In the hot climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important."},{"kind":"audio","t":11481.664863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11483.780143,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11485.054279,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11485.672618,"samples":17496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":19433.455737,"text":"Presque tous les pirages sont sablonneux et permettent de se baigner en toute sécurité, la plupart sont ombragés par des pollues du cacao."},{"kind":"text","t":19779.932492,"text":"Almost all the beaches are sandy and allow for safe swimming, most are shaded by cocoa trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":19836.395336999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19838.038366999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19839.685462999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":19841.460391,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19843.308048,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":19843.441358,"samples":2960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":27130.11208,"text":"Les meutes sont composées d'un à trois mâles adultes, apparentés ainsi que d'une trentaine de femelles et de lionceaux."},{"kind":"text","t":27501.888425999998,"text":"The prides consist of one to three related adult males, as well as about thirty females and cubs."},{"kind":"audio","t":27559.112015,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27560.555354,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27562.240908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":27564.043057,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27565.831636,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":27566.18091,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":35013.520841,"text":"Les enfants sauvages peuvent avoir suivi de graves abus ou traumatismes avant d'être abandonnés ou de s'enfuir."},{"kind":"text","t":35332.420701999996,"text":"Feral children may have suffered severe abuse or trauma before being abandoned or running away."},{"kind":"audio","t":35389.03852,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":35390.537123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35392.28463,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":35394.06063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35395.932664,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":35396.093505,"samples":7760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":40715.693259,"text":"Le bus 403 de Scotterb se rend régulièrement à Sintra."},{"kind":"text","t":41005.533337,"text":"The Scotterb 403 bus runs regularly to Sintra."},{"kind":"audio","t":41058.439546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41059.964689,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":41061.758154999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41062.643576,"samples":20496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":43696.730575,"text":"avec un arrêt à cabot d'Aroca."},{"kind":"text","t":43934.518469,"text":"with a stop at cabot d'Aroca."},{"kind":"audio","t":43985.179853,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43986.538746,"samples":32032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":52051.534158999995,"text":"Pour admirer les plus beaux panoramas de Hong Kong, quittez l'île et rejoignez le front de mer de Kowloon situé en face."},{"kind":"text","t":52464.458989,"text":"To admire the most beautiful panoramas of Hong Kong, leave the island and head to the Kowloon waterfront located opposite."},{"kind":"audio","t":52524.401284,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":52525.981049,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52527.667774,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":820},{"kind":"audio","t":52533.310376,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52535.054588,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52536.874173,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52538.328169,"samples":28992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"input","t":59993.771591,"text":"Les opinions d'Aristote sur toutes les questions scientifiques, y compris la psychologie, ont été acceptées."},{"kind":"text","t":60299.073011,"text":"Aristotle's views on all scientific questions, including psychology, were accepted."},{"kind":"audio","t":60355.179651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60356.73586,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60358.507343,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60360.262430999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60361.224968,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":67281.52259600001,"text":"L'Australien Mitchell Gourlay est arrivé 11e au Super G Debout Homme."},{"kind":"text","t":67634.43925200001,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gourlay finished 11th in the Men's Super-G Standing."},{"kind":"audio","t":67687.672502,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67689.231476,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67691.03017000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67692.238977,"samples":25896,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":72787.08444800001,"text":"Le tchèque Aldrich Jelinek s'est classé 16e au Super JAC Home."},{"kind":"text","t":73092.352358,"text":"Czech Aldrich Jelinek finished 16th in the Super JAC Home."},{"kind":"audio","t":73147.07188300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73148.67655500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73150.442379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73151.230934,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":82315.056152,"text":"La ville contraste fortement avec les cités du reste du pays car elle possède un style davantage arabe qu'africain."},{"kind":"text","t":82730.08177,"text":"The city contrasts sharply with the towns in the rest of the country because it has a more Arabic than African style."},{"kind":"audio","t":82788.92479300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82790.53323100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82792.27342700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":82793.990588,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":82795.810534,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":82796.856927,"samples":23360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":92057.293,"text":"Aussi, après la Révolution, les métiers furent ouverts à tous les candidats masculins, permettant aux plus ambitieux et aux plus talentueux de réussir."},{"kind":"text","t":92490.948633,"text":"Also, after the Revolution, the professions were opened to all male candidates, allowing the most ambitious and talented to succeed."},{"kind":"audio","t":92551.67030000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92553.14908300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92555.20237,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92556.73719700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":92558.469381,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92560.645372,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92562.032236,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":92562.18345400001,"samples":1024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":100851.74606,"text":"La bombe à fission fonctionne selon le principe suivant. Elle transforme l'énergie en assemblant un noyau d'une myriade de protons et de neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":101154.6168,"text":"The fission bomb works according to the following principle. It transforms energy by assembling a nucleus of a myriad of protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":101208.39608,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":101210.02527900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101211.882861,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":101211.999366,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":101249.188899,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101250.754853,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101252.619676,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101254.410027,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101255.47226400001,"samples":24928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":107400.629774,"text":"Il n'a pas chiffré ses réductions, disant qu'elles seront basées sur la production économique chinoise."},{"kind":"text","t":107742.790204,"text":"He did not quantify his reductions, stating that they will be based on Chinese economic production."},{"kind":"audio","t":107799.70110100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107801.606866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":107803.131177,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107804.925004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107806.79939100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":107806.93161,"samples":4760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":115803.565358,"text":"Il n'existe pas de définition universelle permettant de déterminer si un objet manufacturé est une antiquité."},{"kind":"text","t":116095.57198800001,"text":"There is no universal definition to determine whether a manufactured object is an antiquity."},{"kind":"audio","t":116150.746335,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116152.307381,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":116154.054227,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116155.85441300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":116157.664694,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":116157.823453,"samples":8360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":122083.64693300001,"text":"Certains organismes fiscaux définissent les biens de plus de 100 ans comme des antiquités."},{"kind":"text","t":122388.19840000001,"text":"Some tax authorities define items over 100 years old as antiquities."},{"kind":"audio","t":122443.41436000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122445.03114,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":122446.753779,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122448.534706,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122449.08273000001,"samples":14728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":128228.879235,"text":"Vous n'avez pas forcément besoin d'un yacht dans les archipels et sur les lacs."},{"kind":"text","t":128564.773446,"text":"You don't necessarily need a yacht in the archipelagos and on the lakes."},{"kind":"audio","t":128618.085764,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128619.70399600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":128621.28620500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128622.386839,"samples":23496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":136933.857284,"text":"On dit donc que le rapport d'aspect de ce format en divisant par 12 pour obtenir le plus simple des rapports de nombre entier est de 3 sur 2."},{"kind":"text","t":137478.179771,"text":"It is therefore said that the aspect ratio of this format, dividing by 12 to obtain the simplest integer ratio, is 3 to 2."},{"kind":"audio","t":137538.90948899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137540.557186,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137542.198193,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":137544.018869,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137545.797523,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137547.64510999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":137549.561281,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":137549.720079,"samples":6424,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":143835.83155899998,"text":"Sa réputation en tant qu'épicentre du luxe a débuté aux environs de l'an 400 et a duré jusqu'à 1100 environ."},{"kind":"text","t":144291.22126299998,"text":"Its reputation as an epicenter of luxury began around the year 400 and lasted until approximately 1100."},{"kind":"audio","t":144350.403495,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144351.99934399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144353.651337,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144355.473125,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144357.170998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":144359.010162,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144360.35975099998,"samples":28392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":157033.685615,"text":"Les politiques d'annulation varient, mais à partir de fin mars, la plupart des politiques d'annulation basées sur le coronavirus ne s'étendent pas jusqu'en juillet 2020, date à laquelle les Jeux Olympiques avaient été prévus."},{"kind":"text","t":157652.92421499998,"text":"Cancellation policies vary, but starting in late March, most coronavirus-based cancellation policies do not extend through July 2020, when the Olympic Games had been scheduled."},{"kind":"audio","t":157726.149065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157727.693306,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157729.40917499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157731.286888,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157733.152883,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157734.915603,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157736.732314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157738.463536,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157740.357143,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157741.726631,"samples":28488,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":164620.269874,"text":"Mélangez les deux poudres sèches ensemble puis avec les mains propres et humides, pressez-les en une boule."},{"kind":"text","t":165001.780504,"text":"Mix the two dry powders together, then with clean, damp hands, press them into a ball."},{"kind":"audio","t":165058.41257299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165059.899598,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165061.67282399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165063.415223,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165064.150918,"samples":19528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":174270.04043,"text":"Les croisières à Saint-Pétersbourg incluent du temps passé dans la ville. Les passagers des croisières sont exemptés de l'obligation de visa, voire les conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":174554.733055,"text":"St. Petersburg cruises include time spent in the city. Cruise passengers are exempt from visa requirements, or even the conditions."},{"kind":"audio","t":174596.36723899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174598.009277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174599.72425499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":174599.917566,"samples":11496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":174637.030003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174638.545461,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":174640.235121,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":174642.086794,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":174642.238853,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":185403.17229,"code":1005}]}